\begin{center}
{\Large $if(backcover-symbol)$$backcover-symbol$$else$בְּרֵאשִׁית$endif$}\\[0.1cm]
{\small\itshape\color{LightGray} "In the Beginning" · 起初}

\vspace{0.8cm}

\starsymbol\hspace{0.2cm}{\color{ScriptureGold}\rule{1.8in}{0.8pt}}\hspace{0.2cm}\starsymbol

\vspace{0.8cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 關於本書}\qquad{\large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} About This Book}

\vspace{0.5cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{TextGray}
$if(backcover)$
$backcover$
$else$
本書逐章研讀創世記全書十六章，並加上第十七章作為橋樑篇，追蹤創世記的應許如何在出埃及記與約書亞記中開始實現，整合黃長老查經教導、John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，並以約翰福音1:1-18與希伯來書為理解創世記的鑰匙，貫通聖約、揀選、人類政府與救贖歷史的整體軌跡。全書以創世記1:1與50:26為首尾框架：從「起初，神創造天地」的道，到約瑟「一具棺材在埃及」的盼望，一以貫之，指向那位「昔在、今在、以後永在」的主。

A chapter-by-chapter study of all sixteen chapters of Genesis, plus a seventeenth bridging chapter tracing how Genesis's promises begin their fulfillment in Exodus and Joshua, integrating Elder Wong's Bible teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis, framed throughout by John 1:1-18 and Hebrews as the key to reading Genesis within God's whole redemptive plan. The whole book is bookended by Genesis 1:1 and 50:26 — from the Word who spoke creation into being, to Joseph's coffin in Egypt, sealed in hope, pointing to the One who was, and is, and is to come.
$endif$
\end{minipage}

\vspace{1cm}

